  unitName: Titan Wing Blaze
  unitId: 810045
  unitNumber: 8033
  description: Born an elemental hybrid, Blaze was granted wings of flame and mastery
    over all things fire. During his youth, he trained under the famed elemental
    monks to learn control. During a fiery battle with the Gods, he lost an elemental
    wing in defense of the temple. Amidst gaining back his lost powers, he sense
    deeper purpose in himself. Now he travels the world to seek deeper understanding
    of this purpose.
  summonDesc: Few I know of can control the primal element of fire. Let me join you
    and we will set the world ablaze!
  fusionDesc: The power in my veins surges like boiling lava in a volcano! This is
    good!
  evoDesc: My Titan wing returns! Power burns within me once more. I owe you a debt
    of graditute, summoner!
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
